  "i18n": {
    "en": {
      "path": "/en/collection/world-polymer/brazil-10-reais-2000/",
      "title": "10 Reais, Central Bank of Brazil, Polymer | Notofilia",
      "description": "Catalog record numismático: banknote conmemorativo de 10 Reais de Brasil, polymer, 500 años del Descubrimiento, portrait of Pedro Álvares Cabral.",
      "ogTitle": "Central Bank of Brazil — 10 Reais de Polymer (2000)",
      "ogDescription": "Banknote conmemorativo de 10 Reais de Brasil, polymer: portrait of Pedro Álvares Cabral y los 500 años del Descubrimiento. Colección privada…",
      "template": "<div lang=\"en\" style=\"width:100%; min-height:100vh; background:#0a0a09; font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n\n  \n\n  \n\n  <main data-pagefind-meta=\"url:/en/collection/world-polymer/brazil-10-reais-2000/\" id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-screen-label=\"Central Bank of Brazil — 10 Reais (2000)\" style=\"max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:56px 24px 80px; outline:none;\">\n\n    <a href=\"/en/collection/world-polymer/\" style=\"display:inline-block; color:#e7ddc4; text-decoration:none; font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.08em; margin-bottom:24px;\">&larr; World polymer banknote catalog</a>\n\n    <div style=\"background:#d8d2cd; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.08); border-radius:3px; padding:clamp(28px,4vw,64px); box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);\">\n\n      <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center;\">\n\n        <div style=\"text-align:center; max-width:720px; margin:0 auto 40px;\">\n          <span style=\"display:block; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.22em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; margin-bottom:14px;\">World Polymer Banknotes &middot; Brazil &middot; 2000</span>\n\n          <h1 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px); line-height:1.08; letter-spacing:0.01em; color:#1c1a15; margin:0 0 12px;\">Central Bank of Brazil</h1>\n\n          <p style=\"font-size:clamp(19px,2vw,23px); font-style:italic; color:#4a4331; margin:0;\">Dez Reais &middot; Pedro Álvares Cabral &middot; 500 Years of the Discovery of Brazil</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:560px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 auto 56px;\">\n          <button\n            data-zoom-trigger=\"brazil-10-reais-2000-polimero\"\n            aria-label=\"Enlarge image of the banknote\"\n            style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in;\"\n          >\n            <picture>\n              <source srcset=\"/uploads/brazil-banco-central-10-reais-2000-polimero.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n              <img\n                src=\"/uploads/brazil-banco-central-10-reais-2000-polimero.jpg\"\n                alt=\"Banknote conmemorativo de 10 Reais de polymer de Central Bank of Brazil, obverse arriba con el portrait of Pedro Álvares Cabral y el mapa Terra Brasilis, reverse abajo con el mapa estilizado de Brasil formado por rostros que representan la diversidad étnica del país\"\n                width=\"564\"\n                height=\"533\"\n                loading=\"eager\"\n                decoding=\"async\"\n                style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto;\"\n              />\n            </picture>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>Enlarge</span>\n          </button>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Obverse (top) and reverse (bottom) — Notofilia.com Collection</span>\n<div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Country</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Brazil</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Issuing Entity</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Central Bank of Brazil (BCB)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Denomination</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Diez Reais (10 Reais) &mdash; commemorative banknote</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Material</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Polymer &mdash; Guardian&trade; substrate (BOPP film)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Printer</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Casa da Moeda do Brasil (CdM-B)<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">1</sup></span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Year of Issue</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">2000, no printed date (ND) &mdash; commemorates April 22, 1500</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Dimensions</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">140 &times; 65 mm<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">2</sup></span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Rarity</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Withdrawn from circulation because of the fragility of this first-generation substrate; today it is a commemorative piece sought by collectors</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Catalog Reference</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Pick-248a, Standard Catalog of World Paper Money (variety with abbreviated &ldquo;PEDRO A. CABRAL&rdquo;; P-248b bears the full name)<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">3</sup></span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n          \n            <div\n              role=\"dialog\"\n              aria-modal=\"true\"\n              aria-label=\"Enlarged banknote\"\n              data-zoom-dialog=\"brazil-10-reais-2000-polimero\" hidden\n             \n             class=\"catalog-zoom-dialog\">\n              <button\n                data-zoom-close\n                aria-label=\"Close\"\n                style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:28px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.4); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:22px; line-height:1; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer;\"\n              >&times;</button>\n\n              <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; left:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.25); border-radius:999px; padding:6px;\">\n                <button type=\"button\" data-zoom-out\n                  disabled=\"true\"\n                  aria-label=\"Zoom out\"\n                  style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n                >&minus;</button>\n                <span data-zoom-percent style=\"min-width:56px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; color:#e7ddc4; letter-spacing:0.05em;\">100%</span>\n                <button\n                  disabled=\"false\"\n                  data-zoom-in aria-label=\"Zoom in\"\n                  style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n                >&#43;</button>\n              </div>\n\n              <div\n                style=\"overflow:hidden; max-width:calc(100vw - 16px); max-height:calc(100vh - 16px); touch-action:none;\"\n              >\n                <picture>\n                  <source srcset=\"/uploads/brazil-banco-central-10-reais-2000-polimero.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n                  <img data-zoom-image\n                    src=\"/uploads/brazil-banco-central-10-reais-2000-polimero.jpg\"\n                    alt=\"Banknote conmemorativo de 10 Reais de polymer de Central Bank of Brazil, enlarged view\"\n                    draggable=\"false\"\n                    style=\"display:block; max-width:calc(100vw - 16px); max-height:calc(100vh - 16px); width:auto; height:auto; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\"\n                  />\n                </picture>\n              </div>\n\n              <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:16px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#b7ab8a; font-style:italic; pointer-events:none;\">Drag to move &middot; Mouse wheel to zoom</span>\n            </div>\n          \n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px;\">\n          \n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:44px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Historical and Issue Context</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">A tribute to the V Centennial:</strong>To commemorate the 500th anniversary of the discovery of Brazil by the Portuguese navigator Pedro Álvares Cabral, on April 22, 1500, Banco Central do Brasil issued this commemorative 10 Reais banknote in polymer: the first of its kind in the country.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">4</sup></p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Guardian&trade; Technology:</strong>printed on a bioriented polypropylene (BOPP) substrate developed by Securency International, a joint venture with the Reserve Bank of Australia (today CCL Secure); The Casa da Moeda do Brasil applied the layers of white opacifying ink on the transparent base, leaving the security windows free.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">5</sup></p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">A short-term experiment:</strong>unlike later generations of the substrate, this first version became brittle and was prone to tearing completely from a small notch on the edge, prompting Banco Central do Brasil to remove it from active circulation.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">6</sup></p>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Key Details Visible on the Banknote</h2>\n            <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Obverse:</strong>portrait of Pedro Álvares Cabral, the map &ldquo;Terra Brasilis&rdquo; &mdash; one of the earliest depictions of the discovered land &mdash;, a passage from Pero Vaz de Caminha's letter to King Manuel I of Portugal, a 16th-century Portuguese compass rose, and five ships from Cabral's expedition.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">7</sup></span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Reverse:</strong>stylized map of Brazil composed of faces that represent the ethnic diversity of the country &mdash;white, black and indigenous&mdash;, along with the Cross of the Order of Christ, present on the Portuguese ships of the time.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">8</sup></span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Transparent window:</strong>translucent cutout shaped like a stylized shield; within it, a dark-red circular shadow image serves as a watermark, visible when held to the light.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">9</sup></span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Watermark:</strong>a sailing ship, integrated into the polymer substrate.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">10</sup></span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Tactile printing:</strong>raised intaglio ink allowing visually impaired users to identify the denomination.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Color:</strong>orange and blue tones predominate over a multicolored background, with serial numbering in dark ink.</span>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Additional Context</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\">Brazil was one of the first Latin American countries to experiment with the polymer substrate, although limited to this short-run commemorative issue; the country would not adopt the polymer widely until later denominations of the Real family, within the global wave of adoption of the plastic substrate documented in the catalog of World Polymer Banknotes in this collection.</p>\n          </section>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px; margin:44px auto 0; padding-top:20px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n        <h2 style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 10px; font-style:normal;\">Notes</h2>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">1. World Banknotes &amp; Coins. &ldquo;Brazil 10 Real Polymer Commemorative banknote 2000.&rdquo;<em>worldbanknotescoins.com</em>: printer Casa da Moeda do Brasil (CMB); designer Tereza Regina Barja Fidalgo.</p>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">2. Numista. &ldquo;Banknotes from Brazil.&rdquo;<em>en.numista.com</em>: dimensions of 140 &times; 65 mm for the P# 248.</p>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">3. Numista, note #202403 and PMG Notes. &ldquo;Featured Note of the Month: Brazil 10 Reais&rdquo;: distinction between the variant P-248a (abbreviated name) and P-248b (Cabral's full name).</p>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">4. PMG Notes, id.: note commemorating the 500th anniversary of the discovery of Brazil by Pedro Álvares Cabral on April 22, 1500.</p>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">5. CCL Secure. Corporate information on the Guardian&trade; polymer substrate, originally developed by Securency International (now CCL Secure).</p>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">6. History of withdrawal from circulation documented by collectors and numismatic catalogs of Brazilian banknotes; Characteristic fragility of the first generation of the polymer substrate.</p>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">7. World Banknotes &amp; Coins, id.: description of the obverse &mdash;portrait of Cabral, map &ldquo;Terra Brasilis&rdquo;, passage from the letter of Pero Vaz de Caminha, Rosa de los Vientos and five ships of the expedition.</p>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">8. World Banknotes &amp; Coins, ibid.: reverse description &mdash;a stylized map of Brazil formed by faces representing the country’s ethnic diversity, and the Cross of the Order of Christ.</p>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">9. World Banknotes &amp; Coins, id.: transparent window with a red circular shadow image inside.</p>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0;\">10. World Banknotes &amp; Coins, ibid.: watermark of a sailing ship.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  \n\n</div>",
      "recordTitle": "Central Bank of Brazil",
      "eyebrow": "World Polymer Banknotes · Brasil · 2000"
    }
  }
}
